# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Declare dependencies {#declare-dependencies}"
msgstr "Dichiara le dipendenze {#declare-dependencies}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A managed workflow runs in a Python environment that it prepares in advance. The job cannot reach the internet, so it cannot `pip install` packages. Instead, Qiskit and a list of [supported packages](#check-which-packages-are-installed) are already installed, and you can [upload wheels](#add-your-own-packages) for any other package that your workflow needs.\n"
msgstr "Un workflow gestito viene eseguito in un ambiente Python che prepara in anticipo. Il job non può accedere a internet, quindi non può eseguire `pip install` per i pacchetti. Invece, Qiskit e un elenco di [pacchetti supportati](#check-which-packages-are-installed) sono già installati, e puoi [caricare wheel](#add-your-own-packages) per qualsiasi altro pacchetto di cui il tuo workflow ha bisogno.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check which packages are installed {#check-which-packages-are-installed}"
msgstr "Controlla quali pacchetti sono installati {#check-which-packages-are-installed}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every job runs with Python 3.12 on Linux (x86_64), with the following packages installed:\n"
msgstr "Ogni job viene eseguito con Python 3.12 su Linux (x86_64), con i seguenti pacchetti installati:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, `qiskit-serverless`, and their dependencies, such as `numpy`.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, `qiskit-serverless` e le loro dipendenze, come `numpy`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The supported packages, such as `qiskit-aer`, `qiskit-addon-sqd`, `qiskit-addon-utils`, `qiskit-mitigation`, `qiskit-addon-slc`, `qiskit-paulice`, `ffsim`, and `pyscf`. Each is installed at one fixed version.\n"
msgstr "I pacchetti supportati, come `qiskit-aer`, `qiskit-addon-sqd`, `qiskit-addon-utils`, `qiskit-mitigation`, `qiskit-addon-slc`, `qiskit-paulice`, `ffsim` e `pyscf`. Ognuno è installato a una versione fissa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see the supported packages and their versions, call `dependencies_versions()` from your local notebook:\n"
msgstr "Per vedere i pacchetti supportati e le loro versioni, chiama `dependencies_versions()` dal tuo notebook locale:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* REVIEW: dependencies_versions() lists only requirements-dynamic-dependencies.txt. It omits qiskit, qiskit-ibm-runtime, qiskit-serverless, and numpy, although they are installed. */}\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr ""
"{/* REVIEW: dependencies_versions() lists only requirements-dynamic-dependencies.txt. It omits qiskit, qiskit-ibm-runtime, qiskit-serverless, and numpy, although they are installed. */}\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your workflow can import any of these packages without setup. The workflow installs them when it builds the environment, not when a job starts, so they do not add to the start time of a job.\n"
msgstr "Il tuo workflow può importare uno qualsiasi di questi pacchetti senza alcuna configurazione. Il workflow li installa quando costruisce l'ambiente, non quando un job viene avviato, quindi non aumentano il tempo di avvio di un job.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A workflow does not read a `requirements.txt` or `pyproject.toml` file, so it does not install the packages that these files list. The `dependencies` argument of `ManagedWorkflow` is deprecated and ignored, so it does not install packages either. Remove it from your upload code, and [upload wheels](#add-your-own-packages) instead.\n"
msgstr "Un workflow non legge un file `requirements.txt` o `pyproject.toml`, quindi non installa i pacchetti elencati in questi file. Anche l'argomento `dependencies` di `ManagedWorkflow` è deprecato e ignorato, quindi non installa pacchetti. Rimuovilo dal tuo codice di caricamento e [carica invece le wheel](#add-your-own-packages).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
